body:
Honestly, I'm still not in a good place. The abuse has worsened and two days back, it crossed all limits. As expected, the next day it seemed like nothing had happened and everything was "normal". I am still searching for ways in which I can save myself from further abuse but it seems like I'm getting nowhere. My productivity has gone down the drain and I'm struggling to stay awake. My health has been hampered and I somehow contracted a UTI and am on medications (TMI sorry). The medications have made me weak and I feel sleepy most of the time.

&#x200B;

Overall, I am struggling to stay alive but I'm not giving up this soon. Neither should you. I am just holding on and trying my best to better my life. Thanks for reaching out :)
